# qylock font manifest
# ---------------------
# Themes that need a font qylock cannot ship. `qylock-fetch-fonts` reads this.
#
# Format (pipe-separated, '#' starts a comment):
#   theme_relpath | dest_filename | display_name | license_note | source
#
# `source` may be:
#   (empty)            you must supply the font yourself (see below)
#   https://…          downloaded with curl
#   copy:<other_theme> copied from a font another theme already ships
#
# To supply a font you legally own, either:
#   * qylock-fetch-fonts --install <theme> /path/to/font.ttf
#   * put a URL in this file's `source` column, or in ~/.config/qylock/fonts.manifest
#   * export QYLOCK_FONT_URL__<theme>=https://…   (e.g. QYLOCK_FONT_URL__nier_automata=…)
#
# theme         | filename             | display name      | license note                              | source
nier-automata   | FOT-Rodin Pro DB.otf | FOT-Rodin Pro DB  | proprietary (Fontworks) — supply your own |
terraria        | Andy Bold.ttf        | Andy Bold         | proprietary (Monotype) — supply your own  |
Genshin         | zhcn.ttf             | HYWenHei-85W      | proprietary (Hanyi) — supply your own     |
minecraft       | minecraft.ttf        | Minecraft Regular | free for personal use — supply your own   |
star-rail       | font.ttf             | DIN Next          | proprietary (Linotype) — supply your own  |
windows_7       | segoeui.ttf          | Segoe UI          | proprietary (Microsoft) — supply your own |
osumania        | Torus Regular.otf    | Torus Regular     | copied from the osu! theme                | copy:osu
